        <mxCell id="activity" value="&lt;b&gt;[E] Shared Activity store / projection&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;agents/activity/&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Retain raw/normalized receipts and present the run in graph-wide Activity. Native decoding remains provider-owned." style="shape=rectangle;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fillColor=#EAF0FA;strokeColor=#8193A5;fontColor=#20384A;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="col_2">
